     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;">关于做好2020学年校级及以上优秀班主任评比工作的通知</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;">全校教工：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;">根据上级部门相关文件通知，2020学年校级及以上优秀班主任的推荐、评比工作已经开始，请年级按照要求，做好推荐评比工作。先进候选人名单请于7月8日（周五）17:00前，以书面形式报德育处。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;">德育处</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;">2020年7月6日</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.49in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>绍兴一中2020学年校级及以上各项先进推荐、评比方案</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.49in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、指导思想</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按照“师德为首，业绩突出，群众公认”的原则，把真正为学校教育、教学、管理、服务工作付出辛勤劳动、做出突出成绩和较大贡献的教工推荐出来，凝聚正能量，倡导新风尚，促进新发展。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、评比流程</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按照“组内先推荐、处室再考核、学校后评定”的流程做好各项先进人选的推荐、考核与评定工作。各组须按评比条件规定的条款如实推荐，相关职能处室须依据“德、勤、能、绩、廉”对推荐人选进行考核打分，学校综合各方面情况进行最终人选的调整与评定。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、评比条件</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（一）符合下列条件的教工在同等条件下优先推荐为先进候选人：</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.满工作量或超工作量； 教学业绩突出，所带班级学生在学校统一组织的大型考试中平均分提高率或优秀人数提高率位于同学科组前三分之一的教师；在学科竞赛辅导中有取得突出成绩或明显进步的辅导教师；在特长生培养中成绩突出的教师；（教学处负责考核）</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.积极发扬奉献精神，主动代课或承担监考、命题和高考阅卷等教育教学工作和服从学校安排承担超工作量的教师；（教学处负责考核）</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.重视学科教学研究，积极承担选修课课程开发与实施任务；在优质课等教学业务比赛中获市属级一等奖及以上奖项的教师；教研成果在学科正规刊物公开发表或在省市评比中获市级一等奖及以上的教师；（教科室负责考核）</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4．教学满意度调查结果优良，受到学生、家长、同事的好评；（教科室负责考核）</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.师德优良，无家长教学质量等方面的事实投诉和有偿家教等有损师德师风的情况。（党政办负责考核）</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（二）有下列行为的教工不能推荐：</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.有从事有偿家教或在校外培训机构兼课的教师；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.出现重大教育教学和安全事故的教师；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.不服从学校正常工作安排和非学校原因而工作量不满的教工；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.年度事假累计超过一周，病假累计超过二周的教工（除产假）；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.出勤考核（包括升旗仪式、开学典礼、教工会议等）有无故缺勤、迟到或早退行为的教工；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6. 教学能力与教学业绩、教学满意度测评等位居年级后面的教师。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四、推荐名额</strong></span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 19.6pt;"><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-bottom-color: initial; border-right-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 106.3pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.25in;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>先进名称</strong></span></p></td><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-bottom-color: initial; border-right-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 99.25pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.25in;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>先进指标</strong></span></p></td><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-bottom-color: initial; border-right-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 92.1pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.25in;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>推荐名额</strong></span></p></td><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-bottom-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 70.9pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>负责人（处室）</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 0.77in;"><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-right-color: initial; border-top-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 106.3pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校级优秀班主任</span></p></td><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-right-color: initial; border-top-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 99.25pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一年级</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二年级</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三年级</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span></p></td><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-right-color: initial; border-top-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 92.1pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一年级</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二年级</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三年级</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span></p></td><td style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-top-color: initial; padding: 0px 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle; width: 70.9pt;"><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年级长</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">德育处</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>五、推荐要求</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1．各年段（组）要对照评比条件民主评议，采用无记名投票方式，把真正优秀的人选推荐出来；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2．推荐过程中不能论资排辈，不能搞照顾，不能拉票；</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3. 校级优秀班主任要求年度班级考核排名在年段前三分之二； 推荐市直学校优秀班主任应具备下列条件：热爱班主任工作，担任班主任工作3年及以上，认真履行班主任职责，工作责任心强，成绩突出，所带班级已形成良好的学风、班风。年度班级考核排名在年段前三分之一。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
